# Google Apps Script URL (Recommended - Simple & Free!)
# Follow GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_SETUP.md to get this URL
# Example: https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby.../exec
VITE_GOOGLE_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=your-google-apps-script-url-here

